  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Demonic Intellect</em></p>\n<p>Through refining your ability, you have become more skilled in using your technique in combat and can add your Intelligence modifier to Initiative rolls. Additionally, when using <em>Demonic Intellect</em>, you gain the following additional benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You add your proficiency bonus to any saving throws you make if you don’t already.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can spend 1 CE to gain an additional reaction each round.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Once per round you can add your Intelligence modifier to a damage roll you make.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
